<Slide style={{ padding: '22px 64px 18px 64px', background: '#F7F4EC' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 102, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>第 4 步 · 粘贴 DeepSeek API Key</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.72)', marginTop: 6 }}>回车选中 DeepSeek 后，OMP 会直接给出取 Key 的地址和一个粘贴框</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ padding: '10px 18px', background: '#1D1B16', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B8730F' }}>Key 以 sk- 开头</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 534, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 273, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Image src="assets/omp_apikey.png" style={{ width: 937, height: 273, borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 245, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 11, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>① 先去拿 Key</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>浏览器打开 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8A5608' }}>platform.deepseek.com/api_keys</span>，新建一个 Key 并复制。它是花钱的凭据，别外传。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 11, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>② 粘贴并回车</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>在 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>&gt;</span> 后面粘贴，回车提交。OMP 会把它存到本机凭据库里，之后不用再输。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 18, background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.10)', borderRadius: 11, border: '1px solid rgba(184,115,15,0.42)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8A5608' }}>③ 已经配过就不用重来</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.80)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>上一页那个绿标说明本机已有 Key。这时直接按 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Esc</span> 取消即可，不影响使用。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.48)' }}>粘贴时终端可能不显示字符，那是正常的隐藏回显</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.48)' }}>11 / 40</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
